  <header class="academy-hero"><div class="shell academy-hero__copy"><p class="eyebrow">Archive boundary</p><h1>Explanation follows evidence.</h1><p>Educational material is an institute-level output, not a current Sekiya programme. Historical rooms remain available as archive material; they are not claims of a current curriculum or of newly verified teaching artifacts.</p></div></header>
  <section class="ruled-section shell"><div class="section-rail"><p class="eyebrow">Current rule</p><h2>Publish a mechanism only when its source and limits are clear.</h2></div><div class="section-content"><p class="section-intro">A future explanation must identify its canonical source, evidence state, disclosure boundary and limitations. This route does not activate lessons, a platform or a publication schedule.</p></div></section>
</Base>
